{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "neighbor_unit_ids": ["tag:0005:title"], "policy_revision": "git:f670695f81c7b758f4623ab8718dc6cf2221d39e", "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "unit_id": "tag:0005:p001"}, "context_hash": "sha256:24022f4a37a3c03224b8f7a032790b115c08445ccf1705991a23dcbdcb3b18b3", "created_at": "2026-08-25T01:40:00+08:00", "glossary_revision": "git:61cab81ecc45cb258037d5f062f36255137ccaf4", "harness_id": "codex", "harness_version": "unknown", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-sol", "model_identity_confidence": "owner-confirmed", "model_lane": "openai-gpt-5.6-sol", "model_record_id": "openai:gpt-5.6-sol:owner-confirmed", "model_snapshot": null, "notes": ["上游 TeX 引号 ``small'' 与 ``big'' 在自然语言源节点中规范化为 Unicode 弯引号。"], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "not_exposed", "run_id": "legacy-conventions-0005-gpt56sol", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d79423fefad5d444137df5bc2ebb7be2d33c7d4cdd3f6f1adbc295bedb301ad3", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "set of objects", "target_term": "对象集"}, {"source_term": "pair of objects", "target_term": "一对对象"}, {"source_term": "set of morphisms", "target_term": "态射集"}, {"source_term": "“small” category", "target_term": "“小”范畴"}, {"source_term": "“big” categories", "target_term": "“大”范畴"}, {"source_term": "categories whose objects form a proper class", "target_term": "其对象构成一个真类的范畴"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "Remark", "target_term": "注记"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "范畴（category）<MATH_0001> 由一个对象集（set of objects）以及每一对对象（pair of objects）之间的一个态射集（set of morphisms）组成。换言之，它就是其他文献中所谓的“小”范畴（“small” category）。我们也会使用“大”范畴（“big” categories）（即其对象构成一个真类的范畴（categories whose objects form a proper class）），但仅限于《范畴（Categories）》中注记（Remark）<REF_0001> 所列的那些。", "translation_hash": "sha256:403af8c27dac695f5ba044700d946c3b836747a8bd5b2fc3e4d3921b9d145bcc", "unit_id": "tag:0005:p001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "给出范畴的组成约定。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "范畴的对象集合。", "source_term": "set of objects", "target_term": "对象集"}, {"context": "指定态射集所对应的两个对象。", "source_term": "pair of objects", "target_term": "一对对象"}, {"context": "两个对象之间的态射集合。", "source_term": "set of morphisms", "target_term": "态射集"}, {"context": "其他文献对本节范畴约定的称呼。", "source_term": "“small” category", "target_term": "“小”范畴"}, {"context": "对象可能不构成集合的范畴。", "source_term": "“big” categories", "target_term": "“大”范畴"}, {"context": "说明本节所称大范畴的集合论性质。", "source_term": "categories whose objects form a proper class", "target_term": "其对象构成一个真类的范畴"}, {"context": "引用上游同名章节。", "source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "引用目标的结构类型。", "source_term": "Remark", "target_term": "注记"}]}
